# Baseline B-06 (negotiation-6): a manifest-v1 slot (00 00 01 FF) never
# matches, so the 4.4 slot after it is answered with the plain version
# 00 00 04 04, and the connection then serves a session: HELLO succeeds
# (ADR-0303; the manifest answer of F-06 is deferred). The leading
# C: <RAW> is the script's own handshake, so there is no automatic one and
# no !: AUTO HELLO.
!: AUTO GOODBYE

C: <RAW> 60 60 B0 17 00 00 01 FF 00 00 04 04 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
S: <RAW> 00 00 04 04
C: HELLO {"user_agent": "relate-bolt-compat/1.0", "scheme": "none"}
S: SUCCESS {}
